'''Eggs''' are laid by [[Kephri]] during the [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid, as part of her 'Mass Incubation' attack. Kephri can use this special attack while shielded, splattering two types of egg across the arena: a small light-coloured egg and a large darker-coloured egg. If left unattended, the lighter eggs will explode in a 3x3 area, while the darker eggs will hatch [[Agile Scarab]]s.

Players will always inflict their maximum hit on the eggs regardless of their combat style.

